title: "crnt-lean: Chemical Reaction Network Theory in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 formalization of Chemical Reaction Network Theory,
  with decidable structural criteria and exact certificates aimed at biochemical
  design automation.
